#describe what The macro, PR review and graph e2e scripts now exit zero: 25 failing specs follow the current UI, 1 was a real app bug, 2 were stale pixel baselines.
#describe what Only the primary mouse button now selects or pins in the Pixi graph, so a right-click or right-drag no longer selects a card and scrolls the view.
#describe before Baseline: macro 13 failed, PR review 5, graph 9; a right-click on a node selected it.
#describe after Macro 41, PR review 10 and graph 42 tests pass, twice in a row; a right-click leaves the selection alone.
#describe verified typecheck, lint, pnpm test, and the three e2e scripts twice each.
