#reason test/e2e/support/overview.ts One place that opens and closes the Overview drawer for the macro specs.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/index.ts Stops a right or middle click on the canvas background from clearing the selection and scrolling.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/node-graphics.ts A right-click on a node, tile or block used to select it and start a scroll animation that fought the right-drag pan.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/open-actions.ts Names the primary-button check once so every Pixi tap handler can share it.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/relation-graphics.ts A right-click on a relation area no longer pins it.
#reason test/e2e/graph-macro-areas.spec.ts The panel it reads is now the Overview drawer, which is hidden until opened.
#reason test/e2e/graph-macro-foundation.spec.ts The chips and details it clicks now live in the Overview drawer.
#reason test/e2e/graph-macro-legend.spec.ts The legend is in the Overview drawer, and the map must be clicked with the drawer shut.
#reason test/e2e/graph-macro-platform-uses.spec.ts The chips and the legend it reads are in the Overview drawer.
#reason test/e2e/graph-macro-systems.spec.ts The system details are in the Overview drawer, so the spec opens it to read them and closes it to click the list.
#reason test/e2e/graph-navigation.spec.ts The hidden Overview aside also matches the side-panel selector, which broke strict mode.
#reason test/e2e/graph-pixi.spec.ts The canvas tooltip is carried by data-tip now, not title.
#reason test/e2e/pane-overflow.spec.ts Opens the Overview drawer for the picked system and picks the Explain intent before the Explain chip of the new composer.
#reason test/e2e/pr-review-comments.spec.ts The first card in the review body is the hidden one, so geometry is scoped to the visible body.
#reason test/e2e/pr-review-regions.spec.ts The hidden Overview aside also matches the side-panel selector, which broke strict mode.
#reason test/e2e/snapshots/darwin/pixi-overview.png Baseline predated the redesigned PR strip, so it is regenerated.
#reason test/e2e/snapshots/darwin/pixi-selected.png Baseline predated the redesigned PR strip, so it is regenerated.
#reason test/e2e/support/overflow.ts Checks the Overview drawer for clipped text when it is open.
#story Right-clicking the graph no longer selects
#step actor A reviewer
#step action right-clicks or right-drags on the graph
